        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Yomawari is a Japanese horror action game and features a female protagonist that is searching for her older sister and pet dog, while exploring a creepy town at night. She only has a flashlight at her disposal, and using said flash light will let her “see things that shouldn’t be seen.”",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Yomawari es un juego de acción y terror japonés con una protagonista que busca a su hermana mayor y a su perro mientras explora un pueblo siniestro de noche. Solo dispone de una linterna, y usarla le permite «ver cosas que no deberían verse».",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
