        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The dark is no place to be alone. After a beautiful show of summer fireworks, two young girls begin to make their way home. However, a mysterious attacker separates them, and both must brave the haunting night filled with unspeakable terrors and survive the darkness.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "La oscuridad no es lugar para estar solo. Tras un espectacular espectáculo de fuegos artificiales de verano, dos niñas emprenden el camino a casa. Sin embargo, un misterioso atacante las separa, y ambas deben afrontar la inquietante noche, llena de terrores indescriptibles, y sobrevivir a la oscuridad.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
